INTERFACE IModeConditionProvider
]]></Declaration>
    <Method Name="checkModeIsAllowed" Id="{31fb16ba-145d-460c-9dea-5a3b8fe2dd05}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This method checks the start conditions for the selected operation mode.
If the mode is allowed to be started, it returns TRUE.

legal notes
=================
